          "result": "official reader text retrieved",
          "support": "Free cookie consent management tool by cite0†TermsFeed Generator†www.termsfeed.com L1: \ncite1†Image: Saigon Centre Logo L3: \n×\n[Input: Search...]\ncite2†Shopping Mall L9: \ncite3†Office†office.saigoncentre.com.vn L11: \ncite4†Living†sedonavietnam.com L13: \ncite5†Home L15: \n[Button: EN]|[Button: VI]\ncite6†Image: TUDOR L19: \ncite7†Image: thumb-0 L21: \ncite7†Image: thumb-0 L23: \ncite7†Image: thumb-0 L25: \ncite5†Home •cite8†Store Directory •TUDOR\n# TUDOR\ncite9†Image: TUDOR L30: \nTUDOR is a Swiss made watch brand, offering mechanical watches with sophisticated style, superior quality, and unique value for money. The origins of the TUDOR brand date back to 1926, when ‘The Tudor’ was first registered on behalf of Hans Wilsdorf. Over the course of history, TUDOR watches became the choice of daring individuals worldwide on land, ice, in the air and underwater.\nLoading map...\nLocation\nL1-10\nCategory\ncite10†Jewelry & Watches , cite11†Luxury Brands L42: \nPhone\n028 3636 9860\nOperating hours\n09:30 - 21:30\ncite12†Image: Saigon Centre L51: ### Operating Hours\n### Contact Us\nDownload IKONIC app\nCooperation and Development\ncite13†Image: RESCO L60: \ncite5†Home L62: \n© 2016 Keppel Land Watco-II Co., Ltd. All rights reserved.\nBusiness Registration Certificate No. 0310128472, 16th issuance dated 29 April 2026, by the Business Registration Office, Ho Chi Minh City Department of Finance.\ncite14†Privacy Policy"
