          "url": "https://www.jins.com/vn/en/frames/",
          "evidenceFile": "source-024.txt",
          "reference": "turn397search6",
          "title": "Frames | JINS Eyewear | Prescription Glasses (https://www.jins.com/vn/en/frames/)",
          "section": "actual product listing / collection catalogue",
          "result": "indexed official text retrieved",
          "support": "Frames | JINS Eyewear | Prescription Glasses FRAMES Explore our diverse collection of frames that seamlessly blend modern aesthetics with practical functionality. From minimalist styles to bold, statement pieces, JINS offers something for everyone. Explore the different styles here and find your perfect fit-- all at an accessible price. DESIGN At JINS, our eyewear is more than an accessory; it is a work of art. Infused with the essence of Japanese aesthetics, each frame showcases a meticulous attention to detail, ensuring that beauty and functionality coexist seamlessly. Our design philosophy embraces simplicity, elegance, and thoughtful craftsmanship, resulting in eyewear that reflects your individuality. JINS believes that premium eyewear should be accessible to all. Our transparent pricing ensures you receive exceptional quality and design at a price that fits your budget, allowing you to enjoy luxury without compromise. QUALITY We believe that good quality is a right that should be guaranteed to all customers. That is why we do our best to guarantee the quality and beauty of our products. No matter where in the world our frames are made, they are thoroughly inspected by a Japanese third party to ensure that they are of the highest Japanese and JINS quality. JINS, prescription eyeglasses and sunglasses that suit your style and budget. A collection with a wide variety of affordable, high quality and stylish frames."
        }
